Rationale: Panorama inverse projections must choose the angular branch centered on the configured image and retain derivatives; partial/offset panoramas otherwise invert incorrectly.
Contract: panorama projection inverses
Tests: tests/houdini_panorama_smoke.py, scripts/verify-upstream-patches.py

